    "About Us",
    "Our milestones",
    "Admiral was set up, a specialist provider of car insurance with 57 members of staff based in Cardiff.",
    "We introduced this cheeky chappy.",
    "We had our millionth claim.",
    "We were the first to launch MultiCar Insurance, a brand new product designed to help customers with two or more cars get a better price for their cover by insuring their cars on one policy.",
    "We began sponsoring the Welsh national rugby team.",
    "We started selling home insurance.",
    "The torch was passed to a new Admiral.",
    "We started selling van insurance.",
    "We branched out into personal loans and car finance.",
    "Designed for people who want just one policy for their home and car, MultiCover is a simple solution - one renewal date, zero hassle.",
    "We sold our first travel insurance policy.",
    "We turned 25!",
    "We insured our four millionth car, meaning we covered one in seven cars in the UK.",
    "Admiral welcomed its 10,000th employee. 25 years after we started, we now employ 10,000 members of staff in eight different countries across the world.",
    "We were named the 20th best workplace in the world in the annual Great Place to Work's World's Best Workplaces list.",
    "We were named the Best Big Company to Work For in the UK at the Sunday Times Best Companies awards. We're also the only company who has made the Sunday Times List every year since it began in 2001!",
    "The arrival of Alfie and the world of Admouth.",
    "We now have more than one million home insurance customers.",
    "We launched the Admiral Stay at Home Refund giving back £110m to our customers.",
    "Our fourth decade in business!",
    "Find out a little more about what we stand for.",
    "Here’s how we gave back to our customers during the Coronavirus lockdown.",
    "Community is important to us and we’re involved with a host of different initiatives and events – both big and small.",
    "From humble beginnings with 57 employees in Cardiff to over 11,000 staff in eight countries – what’s it like to work for Admiral?",
    "We've come a long way, from start-up to delivering award-winning products and services.",
